<h3>50:55 — To overcome: Sun people introduced try-with-resources in 1.7</h3>
<p>To overcome above problems, some people (Sun people) introduced try with resources in 1.7 version.</p>
<h3>51:35 — Main advantage (long dictation)</h3>
<p>The main advantage of try with resources is: whatever resources we opened as a part of try block will be closed automatically once control reaches end of try block, either normally or abnormally, and hence we are not required to close explicitly, so that complexity of programming will be reduced.</p>
<p>We are not required to write finally block, so that length of the code will be reduced and readability will be improved.</p>
